      "blocks": {
        "ns_0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Orders and shipping",
            "anchor_id": "orders",
            "content": "<p><strong>How long does a build take?</strong></p><p>Most systems ship within five to seven business days, including burn-in. Your account shows the current step.</p><p><strong>Is shipping insured?</strong></p><p>Yes. Systems ship insured with internal foam supports. Free on orders over $500.</p>",
            "icon": ""
          }
        },
        "ns_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Warranty",
            "anchor_id": "warranty",
            "content": "<p><strong>What does the warranty cover?</strong></p><p>Parts and labor for three years on systems in this demo, one support line for every component. Final terms are confirmed at launch.</p><p><strong>Does opening the case void it?</strong></p><p>No. Damage caused while working inside the system is not covered.</p>",
            "icon": ""
          }
        },
        "ns_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Compatibility",
            "anchor_id": "compat",
            "content": "<p><strong>Will it drive my display?</strong></p><p>Check the ports table and the resolution target on the product page. A specialist can confirm a specific model.</p><p><strong>Which operating systems are supported?</strong></p><p>Operating-system choices are illustrative in this demo. Confirm support for your software and peripherals before choosing a configuration.</p>",
            "icon": ""
          }
        },
        "ns_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Upgrades",
            "anchor_id": "upgrades",
            "content": "<p><strong>How do I know what I can add?</strong></p><p>The upgrade map on each product page lists free slots, spare connectors and power headroom.</p><p><strong>Can you do the upgrade?</strong></p><p>Yes. The upgrade service retests the system and updates its record.</p>",
            "icon": ""
          }
        },
        "ns_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Returns",
            "anchor_id": "returns",
            "content": "<p><strong>What is the return window?</strong></p><p>Thirty days from delivery in the original packaging. Return shipping is covered for defective systems.</p>",
            "icon": ""
          }
        },
        "ns_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Accessibility",
            "anchor_id": "access",
            "content": "<p>The demo uses native Quadratum navigation, visible focus states and labeled form controls. If an interaction is difficult to use, tell us on the contact page.</p>",
            "icon": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
